# BEGIN REPO-PLATFORM MANAGED
# Baseline attributes from Vivswan/repo-platform; this
# section is replaced on template sync.

# Normalize all detected text files to LF in the repository.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never apply text/EOL normalization to repo symlinks, so a Windows checkout
# (core.symlinks=false) can't turn them into modified regular files.
CLAUDE.md -text
.github/copilot-instructions.md -text
.github/agents.md -text

# Keep binary assets byte-for-byte unchanged.
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary

# Repository-specific attributes (binary globs, linguist overrides) go
# below the END marker; they stay yours across template updates, and the
# LAST matching line wins, so entries there override the managed ones.
# END REPO-PLATFORM MANAGED

*.vsix binary
